an archive to reproduce/patch the issue: [jax-metal-stablehlo-repro.tar.gz](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/27378337/jax-metal-stablehlo-repro.tar.gz)\n\n### Repro\n\nThe repro compiles a frozen StableHLO module, creates dummy inputs with matching shapes/dtypes, executes the compiled program on the `METAL` backend, and then waits for the outputs. Execution returns successfully, but `jax.block_until_ready(outputs)` hangs indefinitely.\n\n```\n$ python3.12 -m venv .venv\n$ source .venv/bin/activate\n$ python -m pip install -r requirements.txt\n\n$ /opt/homebrew/bin/timeout 45 python jax_metal_stablehlo_hang_repro.py\n...\ncompile_start\ncompile_done\ninputs_start\ninputs_done\nexecute_start 0\nexecute_return 0 outputs=15\nblock_start 0\n<hangs>\n```\n### Patch\n\n```\n$ python patch_jax_metal_commit_wait.py --in-place --allow-already-patched\n\n$ python jax_metal_stablehlo_hang_repro.py --materialize-host\ncompile_start\ncompile_done\ninputs_start\ninputs_done\nexecute_start 0\nexecute_return 0 outputs=15\nblock_start 0\nblock_done 0\n...\ndone\n```\n\n### System info (python version, jaxlib version, accelerator, etc.)\n\n### Environment\n\n- Machine: Apple Silicon Mac, `Apple M4 Max`\n- macOS: `26.4.1 (25E253)`\n- Python: `3.12`\n- `jax==0.5.0`\n- `jaxlib==0.5.0`\n- `jax-metal==0.1.1`\n- `numpy==2.1.3`","closed_at":null,"closed_by":null,"comments":1,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/37374/comments","created_at":"2026-05-04T22:32:40Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/37374/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/37374","id":4380112183,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","id":1104782284,"name":"bug","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTA0NzgyMjg0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/